	(text_box "design notes:\n	- STPMIC1 drivers actively maintinaed as of 2026\n	- general archetecture based on fig.32 (pg51) of 'getting started' doc from ST.\n	- V_{dd_IO} is what is the datasheet calls V_{DD}\n	- bus nets setup in project settings\n	- probing should be done by soldering tap to low risk SMD component"
